# Planner TDD dispatch (Cursor)

**Do not enter this loop unless the user explicitly invoked `/planner` or `$planner` in this chat** (slash/skill command, or they named the planner TDD loop as the thing to run). Canonical: `$HOME/Code/dotagents/prompts/planner.md`.

These are **not** entry signals. Implement or answer normally:

- `.claude/PLAN.md` exists from another session
- the user said "ok", "continue", "land that", "fix the nits"
- a question or change about the planner/skills/docs
- missing `/planner` prefix on an ordinary request

Once `/planner` or `$planner` **was** used in this chat: do not edit production or test files. Write `.claude/PLAN.md` only, then Task-spawn `tester`, then `impl-low`/`impl-med`/`impl-high`. Follow-ups in that same chat ("continue", "fix the nits", no prefix) still dispatch. Ask before pytest. `reviewer-fede` only after green.

Allowed without workers even inside a planner chat: questions, reading code, git when the user asked, updating `.claude/PLAN.md`.
